          text: '“It grew!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 312748),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 313800),
          text: 'Imaan exclaimed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 314352),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 317200),
          text: 'Akhlaaq proudly placed his hands on his waist.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 317200),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 318200),
          text: '“See?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 318200),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 320552),
          text: 'I knew it,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 320915),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 321912),
          text: 'Imaan looked at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 321912),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 325472),
          text: '“You were ready to give up yesterday,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 325472),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 328592),
          text: '“That was yesterday,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 328592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 329792),
          text: 'He leaned closer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 329792),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 332752),
          text: '“How long until it becomes a big plant?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 333429),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 333992),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 334429),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 335192),
          text: 'Imaan laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 335192),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 338032),
          text: '“You really haven\'t changed,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 339128),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 340544),
          text: 'Akhlaaq thought for a moment.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 340544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 342064),
          text: '“Maybe tomorrow?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 342904),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 343504),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 344079),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 345064),
          text: 'Imaan shook her head.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 345064),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 346904),
          text: '“No,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 346904),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 348064),
          text: '“The day after?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 348834),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 349384),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 349384),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 351384),
          text: '“Maybe,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 352483),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 353424),
          text: 'Akhlaaq sighed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 353424),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 354072),
          text: '“Fine.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 354072),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 356984),
          text: 'I\'ll wait,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 356984),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 360009),
          text: 'But he kept checking the plant every few minutes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 360009),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 366540),
          text:
              'While Akhlaaq was learning to wait for his plant, Imaan was dealing with something else.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 366540),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 370119),
          text: 'She had been preparing for a school presentation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 370119),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 374691),
          text: 'She had practised several times, but she was not satisfied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 374691),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 377893),
          text: 'She wanted every word to sound perfect.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 377893),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 380278),
          text: 'At home, she practised in front of Abbu.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 381469),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 382293),
          text: '“Assalam o Alaikum.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 382293),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 384528),
          text: 'Good morning, everyone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 384528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 388528),
          text: 'Today I am going to talk about—” Imaan began.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 388528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 389528),
          text: 'She stopped.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 389528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 390728),
          text: '“What happened?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 391028),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 391528),
          text: 'Abbu asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 391528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 394528),
          text: '“I said it wrong,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 394528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 397528),
          text: '“Nobody noticed,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 397528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 400360),
          text: '“I noticed,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 400360),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 402160),
          text: 'She started again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 402160),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 404240),
          text: 'This time she spoke too quickly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 406694),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 407120),
          text: '“Goodmorningeveryone…” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 407516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 408440),
          text: 'Abbu laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 408440),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 409373),
          text: '“Don\'t laugh!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 409788),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 410720),
          text: 'Imaan exclaimed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 410720),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 413520),
          text: '“I\'m sorry,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 413904),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 415440),
          text: 'Imaan became frustrated.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 415440),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 417960),
          text: '“I can\'t do it,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 418855),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 420112),
          text: 'Abbu looked at her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 420112),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 423392),
          text: '“You\'ve been practising for days,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 423392),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 426592),
          text: '“And I\'m still making mistakes,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 426592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 428672),
          text: '“That\'s normal,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 428672),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 432032),
          text: '“I should already be good at it,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 432336),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 433552),
          text: 'Abbu shook his head.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 433552),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 433952),
          text: '“Why?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 434352),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 435019),
          text: 'Abbu asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 436752),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 437952),
          text: 'Imaan did not answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 438504),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 440104),
          text: '“You are learning something new.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 440104),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 443364),
          text: 'Why do you expect yourself to be perfect immediately?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 443762),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 444424),
          text: 'Abbu asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 444801),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 445744),
          text: 'Imaan looked down.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 446091),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 446784),
          text: 'Abbu smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 446784),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 450784),
          text:
              '“Give yourself the same patience you give other people,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 450784),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 452824),
          text: 'That sentence stayed with her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 452824),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 458704),
          text:
              'At school, Ms Sana announced that the presentation competition would take place the following week.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 458896),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 461296),
          text: 'Imaan immediately became nervous.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 461296),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 462350),
          text: '“Next week?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 462877),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 463536),
          text: 'Imaan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 463536),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 465216),
          text: '“Yes,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 465216),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 467416),
          text: '“I\'m not ready,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 467416),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 470376),
          text: '“You don\'t have to be perfect today,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 470718),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 471656),
          text: 'Imaan looked at her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 471656),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 474936),
          text: '“You still have time to improve,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 474936),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 478456),
          text: 'Meanwhile, Akhlaaq had a different problem.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 478488),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 482728),
          text: 'He had forgotten part of his presentation completely.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 482728),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 485728),
          text: '“I\'ll just make something up,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 485728),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 488408),
          text: '“You can\'t do that,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 488408),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 489312),
          text: '“Why not?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 490215),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 490968),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 490968),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 494128),
          text: '“Because you haven\'t prepared,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 494128),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 497088),
          text: '“I\'ll prepare tomorrow,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 497401),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 498480),
          text: 'Ms Sana overheard them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 498480),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 500615),
          text: '“Tomorrow is a useful word, Akhlaaq.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 501326),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 507480),
          text:
              'But it becomes dangerous when we use it for everything,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 507480),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 509060),
          text: 'The class laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 509716),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 511120),
          text: 'Akhlaaq smiled awkwardly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 511120),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 516440),
          text:
              '“Patience doesn\'t mean delaying your responsibilities,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 516440),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 517760),
          text: 'She looked at the students.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 518472),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 526272),
          text:
              '“Sometimes patience means starting early and giving yourself enough time to do something properly,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 526896),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 527832),
          text: 'Imaan nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 528488),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 531112),
          text: 'Akhlaaq quietly opened his notebook.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 531112),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 537272),
          text:
              'That evening, Akhlaaq noticed Abbu leaving the small study where the wooden box had been kept.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 537272),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 538825),
          text: 'The door was slightly open.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 539366),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 544144),
          text:
              'Akhlaaq looked at the doorway, then at the hallway, and then back at the box.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 544784),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 546167),
          text: 'He walked closer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 546167),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 551104),
          text:
              'Just before he reached for the lid, Imaan spoke from behind him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 552123),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 554307),
          text: '“What are you doing?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 554890),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 555618),
          text: 'Imaan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 556491),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 557365),
          text: 'Akhlaaq jumped.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 557365),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 560456),
          text: '“Nothing,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 561633),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 562456),
          text: 'Imaan crossed her arms.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 562456),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 565956),
          text: '“You were about to open it,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 565956),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 569456),
          text: '“I was only going to look,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 569456),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 573956),
          text: '“Opening the lid is more than looking,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 574764),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 575456),
          text: 'Akhlaaq sighed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 575456),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 580008),
          text: '“I just want to know what is inside,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 580471),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 582088),
          text: 'Imaan looked at the box.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 582088),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 584488),
          text: 'She wanted to know too.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 584488),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 585282),
          text: '“So do I.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 585282),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 589568),
          text: 'But Abbu asked us to wait,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 590168),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 592368),
          text: 'Akhlaaq stood quietly for a moment.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 592368),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 594208),
          text: 'Then he stepped away.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 594208),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 596208),
          text: '“Fine,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 596391),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 597488),
          text: 'Imaan smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 597488),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 600480),
          text: '“That was almost patient,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 600480),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 604520),
          text: '“Do not expect miracles,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 604520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 612480),
          text:
              'Later that night, Akhlaaq went downstairs for water and found Abbu sitting near the box with an old key in his hand.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 612971),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 614280),
          text: 'Abbu looked up.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 614280),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 615280),
          text: '“Still curious?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 615955),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 617080),
          text: 'Abbu asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 617410),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 617806),
          text: 'Akhlaaq nodded honestly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 618432),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 621512),
          text: '“Very,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 621512),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 624892),
          text: '“And are you going to open it without permission?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 625455),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 626392),
          text: 'Abbu asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 627084),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 628072),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked down.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 628072),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 630392),
          text: '“No,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 630912),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 631952),
          text: 'Abbu smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 631952),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 633652),
          text: '“Good.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 633652),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 637192),
          text: 'Patience is not only waiting for what we want.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 637192),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 642424),
          text:
              'Sometimes it is respecting a boundary even when curiosity is pushing us,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 643013),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 644424),
          text: 'Akhlaaq sat beside him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 644424),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 646313),
          text: '“Will you ever tell us?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 646869),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 647424),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 647424),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 647774),
          text: '“Yes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 647774),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 654424),
          text:
              'But because you waited, I can show you one part of the story now,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 654424),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 657424),
          text: 'He opened a drawer and took out an old photograph.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 658416),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 666616),
          text:
              'The photograph showed a much younger Abbu standing beside another boy and an older man outside a small workshop.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 666953),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 671416),
          text:
              'Imaan, who had come downstairs after hearing their voices, joined them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 671416),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 672634),
          text: '“Who are they?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 673608),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 674216),
          text: 'Imaan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 674505),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 676816),
          text: 'Abbu pointed to the boy beside him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 676816),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 678316),
          text: '“This is Farhan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 678408),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 680728),
          text: 'He was my school friend,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 680728),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 683048),
          text: 'Then he pointed to the older man.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 683608),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 685450),
          text: '“And this is Mr. Rahman.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 685450),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 688808),
          text: 'He was our teacher and mentor,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 689980),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 692020),
          text: 'Akhlaaq turned the photograph over.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 692020),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 696808),
          text:
              'The same faded date written on the wooden box appeared on the back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 697968),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 699157),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked at Abbu.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 699441),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 702280),
          text: '“What were you doing at that workshop?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 702944),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 703497),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 703829),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 705267),
          text: 'Abbu smiled faintly.',
