          start: Duration(milliseconds: 222245),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224150),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked at his own plant.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226155),
          text: '“Mine has one,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226875),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 229176),
          text: '“And what did you do differently?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 229530),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 230327),
          text: 'Ms Sana asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 232467),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 233281),
          text: 'Akhlaaq thought.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 233281),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 235027),
          text: '“Nothing dramatic.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 235027),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 238867),
          text: 'Water, sunlight, and waiting,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 238867),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 240667),
          text: '“Exactly,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 241141),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 244646),
          text: 'Imaan compared her first entry with the latest one.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 244646),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 250227),
          text:
              'The daily changes had seemed tiny, but the difference across several weeks was obvious.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 251179),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 252639),
          text: '“It is strange.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 252639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 257199),
          text:
              'When I checked every day, it felt as if nothing was happening,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 257199),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 263079),
          text:
              '“Because progress is easier to see across time than across minutes,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263079),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 265699),
          text: '“Can we apply that rule to homework?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 266199),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 266699),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 266699),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270639),
          text: '“Only if you still do the homework,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 271828),
          text: 'The class laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 271828),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 277086),
          text:
              'Later, Imaan received a mathematics exercise back with two mistakes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 277086),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279251),
          text: 'She stared at the red marks.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279251),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282011),
          text: '“I knew this,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282011),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 287011),
          text: '“Knowing and doing are not always the same,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 287011),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 289811),
          text: '“I practised it,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 289811),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 294063),
          text: '“And you will practise it again,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 294667),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 297383),
          text: 'Imaan felt irritation rise.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 297383),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 302023),
          text:
              'For a moment, she wanted to say that she should already be better.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 302023),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 304743),
          text: 'Then she remembered the plant.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 304743),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 309263),
          text: '“Slow progress is still progress,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 309697),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 310783),
          text: 'Ms Sana smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 311155),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 315155),
          text: '“Now you are teaching yourself,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 315155),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 319895),
          text:
              'At home that evening, everyone gathered in the living room after dinner.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 319895),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 323155),
          text: 'The wooden box sat in the centre of the table.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 323533),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 326435),
          text: 'Abbu placed the old key beside it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 327003),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 328595),
          text: 'Akhlaaq stared at the key.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 328595),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 333147),
          text: '“You have been waiting for this, I hear,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 333147),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 337147),
          text: '“For approximately one hundred years,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 337147),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 340147),
          text: '“It has been a few weeks,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 340147),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 343147),
          text: '“It felt longer,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 343500),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 345147),
          text: 'Abbu picked up the key.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 345147),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 348147),
          text: 'Before inserting it, he looked at Farhan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 348147),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 348916),
          text: '“Ready?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 349378),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 350147),
          text: 'Abbu asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 351139),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 353599),
          text: 'Farhan took a slow breath.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 353599),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 356899),
          text: '“This time, yes,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 357291),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 358859),
          text: 'Abbu turned the key.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 358859),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 360719),
          text: 'There was a soft click.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 360719),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 362039),
          text: 'The lock opened.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'patience_en_08',
      title: 'Ep 8 · What Was Lost',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/patience.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/patience/08_what_was_lost.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Things That Take Time — episode 8 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 2608),
          text: 'Episode 8: “What Was Lost”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3648),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 5028),
          text: 'Moral Value: Patience',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 6068),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 9740),
          text: 'For a few seconds, nobody moved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 10264),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 16140),
          text:
              'Akhlaaq leaned forward so far that Imaan gently pulled him back by the sleeve.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 16140),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 19100),
          text: '“Let Abbu open it,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 19100),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 23860),
          text: '“I am only helping from a very close distance,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 24316),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 26140),
          text: 'Abbu lifted the lid.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 26140),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 37052),
          text:
              'Inside the wooden box were several faded photographs, an old notebook, a small envelope, and a bundle of yellowing papers tied with string.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37052),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 40492),
          text: 'Farhan picked up the notebook carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 40492),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 44172),
          text: '“I thought this was gone,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 44172),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 46652),
          text: '“So did I,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 46908),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 48394),
          text: 'Imaan sat beside them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 48394),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 49335),
          text: '“What is it?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 49806),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 50394),
          text: 'Imaan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 50865),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 52982),
          text: 'Abbu opened the first page.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 52982),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 60851),
          text:
              'There were sketches of wheels, handles, frames, measurements, and handwritten calculations.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 60851),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 69026),
          text:
              '“When Farhan and I were students, we wanted to design a simple machine that could help people move heavy boxes,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 69977),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72356),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked impressed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 72356),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 74316),
          text: '“You were building a robot too?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 75079),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 75716),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 75716),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 78436),
          text: '“Not exactly a robot.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 78436),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 82196),
          text: 'More like a small powered trolley,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 82196),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 85116),
          text: '“Still respectable,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 85609),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 86596),
          text: 'Ammi smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 87908),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 89268),
          text: 'Imaan turned several pages.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 89268),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 92108),
          text: 'Many drawings had been crossed out.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 92108),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 96308),
          text: 'Some calculations were corrected again and again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 96308),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 99228),
          text: '“You made a lot of mistakes,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 99228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 101668),
          text: '“A great many,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 101668),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 105428),
          text: '“And we were not patient with them,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 105428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 107668),
          text: 'The room became quieter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 107668),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 112260),
          text: 'Farhan pointed to a page filled with three different designs.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 112260),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 116100),
          text: '“Whenever something failed, we changed the whole idea.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116100),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 121100),
          text:
              'We wanted every attempt to work immediately,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 121100),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 124660),
          text: '“If a wheel slipped, we thought the design was useless.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 124660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 127660),
          text: 'If the frame bent, we wanted a new frame.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 127660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 132372),
          text: 'If progress was slow, we assumed we were failing,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 133003),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133951),
          text: 'Akhlaaq glanced at Imaan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 134852),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 136172),
          text: 'Imaan glanced back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 136172),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 139612),
          text: 'The story sounded uncomfortably familiar.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 139612),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141252),
          text: '“So what happened?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 142015),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 142652),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 142652),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 144812),
          text: '“We stopped,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144812),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 147612),
          text: '“Not because the project was impossible.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 147612),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153524),
          text:
              'We stopped because we became tired of not succeeding quickly,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 153892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 156564),
          text: 'Imaan looked at the unfinished drawings.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 156564),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 160364),
          text: '“You gave up because it was taking too long,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160790),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 161644),
          text: 'Abbu nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 161644),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164764),
          text: 'Farhan opened the small envelope.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164764),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171476),
          text:
              'Inside was a photograph of the old workshop and a short note in Mr. Rahman\'s handwriting.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171476),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 173676),
          text: 'Farhan read it aloud.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 173676),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175176),
          text: '“Keep your work.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175176),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 181816),
          text:
              'One day you may understand what these unfinished pages were trying to teach you,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 181816),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 186376),
          text:
              '“That sounds exactly like something a teacher would write,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 186896),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 187676),
          text: 'Abbu smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187868),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 190668),
          text: '“He was very patient with us,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 190668),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 195548),
          text:
              '“Much more patient than we were with ourselves,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 195548),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 201028),
          text:
              'The next day at school, Imaan told Ms Sana about the notebook.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 201584),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 204508),
          text: 'Ms Sana listened carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 204508),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 207508),
          text: '“What do you think was the real reason they stopped?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 207860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209207),
          text: 'Ms Sana asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209207),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 215198),
          text: '“They thought slow progress meant no progress,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 215198),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 217205),
          text: 'Ms Sana nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 217205),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 220216),
          text: 'She wrote on the board:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 220216),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224900),
          text: 'EFFORT -> TIME -> EXPERIENCE -> PROGRESS',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226020),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 232452),
          text:
              '“People often want to jump directly from effort to success,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 233257),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 234752),
          text: 'Akhlaaq raised his hand.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 234752),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 237379),
          text: '“Can we remove the time part?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 238215),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 238812),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 238812),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 240812),
          text: 'The class laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240812),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 242892),
          text: '“No,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 242892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 245852),
          text: '“Still worth asking,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 245852),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 247507),
          text: '“Time is not always an obstacle.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 247844),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 253844),
          text:
              'Sometimes time is what allows effort to become skill,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 253844),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 260844),
          text:
              'That afternoon, Abbu, Farhan, Imaan, and Akhlaaq spread the old plans across the dining table.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 260844),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 264844),
          text: 'Ammi brought tea for the adults and juice for the children.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 264844),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 266844),
          text: '“We should finish it,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 267836),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 269836),
          text: 'Farhan smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 269836),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270882),
          text: '“How quickly?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270882),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 272556),
          text: 'Uncle Farhan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 273239),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 274036),
          text: 'Akhlaaq stopped.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 274036),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 275756),
          text: 'Everyone looked at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 275756),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279276),
          text: '“I was going to say this weekend,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279857),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 280876),
          text: 'Imaan laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 280876),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 284876),
          text: '“But apparently that is the wrong answer,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 284876),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286636),
          text: '“There is no deadline.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 286636),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 290528),
          text: 'If we try again, we do it properly,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 290528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 292868),
          text: '“Then we need a plan,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 292868),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 295508),
          text: '“Exactly,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 295508),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 308048),
          text:
              'They divided the work into stages: understand the old design, check the measurements, choose safe materials, build one section, test it, and only then move to the next.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 308507),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 309980),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked at the list.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 309980),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 312860),
          text: '“That is a lot of waiting,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 312860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 316460),
          text: '“It is a lot of working carefully,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 316460),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 321900),
          text:
              'Over the next several days, they began building a small modern version of the machine.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 321900),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 324140),
          text: 'The first frame did not fit.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 324617),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 327615),
          text:
              'Akhlaaq reached for another piece immediately, then stopped himself.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 327812),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 330812),
          text: '“Measure first,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 331212),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 331812),
          text: 'Imaan smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 331812),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 334812),
          text: '“I was about to say that,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 334812),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 337812),
          text: '“I am saving you time,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 337812),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 339812),
