          end: Duration(milliseconds: 30602),
          text:
              '“You should probably not say that while he is drinking tea in the next room,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 31099),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 32962),
          text: 'Imaan lowered her voice.',
