          text: '“I said maybe,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 35299),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 40474),
          text: '“That is still a theory about a person,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
