          text: '“Quiet,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 139254),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 146754),
          text: 'At home, Imaan spoke to Farhan carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 146754),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 152754),
          text: '“Uncle Farhan, do you remember the missing page?”',
        ),
