        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 322024),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 323596),
          text: 'Ms Sana smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 323596),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 327123),
          text: '“What have you both learned about patience?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 327123),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 328408),
          text: 'Ms Sana asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 328776),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 329881),
          text: 'Imaan thought first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 329881),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 337428),
          text:
              '“That impatience can make us demand an answer before we have enough information,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 337428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 347300),
          text:
              '“And it can make us rush something, break it, quit it, or keep checking it as if staring will make it faster,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 347300),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 348684),
          text: '“And patience?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 350195),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 351580),
          text: 'Ms Sana asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 351580),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 357420),
          text:
              '“Patience is choosing what to do with the impatient feeling,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 358092),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 359100),
          text: 'Imaan smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 359100),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 361980),
          text: '“Sometimes we wait.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 361980),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 363780),
          text: 'Sometimes we work.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 363780),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 364772),
          text: 'Sometimes we try again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 364772),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 370692),
          text:
              'Sometimes we stop ourselves from making a quick conclusion,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 370692),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 372012),
          text: 'Ms Sana nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 372012),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 375812),
          text: '“That is the lesson,” Ms Sana said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 375812),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 380732),
          text:
              'Several weeks later, the family returned to the workshop for another full test.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 380732),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 384692),
          text:
              'The modern machine stood beside the original unfinished model.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 385055),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 387964),
          text: 'Abbu placed the old notebook on the table.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 387964),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 390684),
          text: 'Farhan checked the final measurements.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 390684),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 393244),
          text: 'Mr. Rahman watched quietly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 393244),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 394070),
          text: '“Ready?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 394897),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 395724),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 397697),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 398604),
          text: 'Abbu smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 398604),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 401484),
          text: '“Ready enough to test,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 401998),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 403644),
          text: 'Akhlaaq pressed the switch.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 403644),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 405777),
          text: 'The machine moved forward.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 405777),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 410205),
          text:
              'It carried a heavy box from one side of the workshop to the other.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 410205),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 414315),
          text: 'It slowed near the centre, corrected itself, and continued.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 414315),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 417221),
          text: 'Nobody spoke until it reached the end.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 417221),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 419643),
          text: 'Then everyone cheered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 420281),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 420918),
          text: '“Mashaa Allah!',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 420918),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 421811),
          text: 'It works!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 421811),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 423723),
          text: 'Akhlaaq exclaimed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 423723),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 427148),
          text: '“It works well,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 427148),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 432268),
          text:
              '“And there is still more we can improve, Inn shaa Allah,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 432793),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 433948),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 433948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 436948),
          text: '“I knew you were going to say that,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 437328),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 441508),
          text: 'Imaan looked at the old photographs beside the new machine.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 441508),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 448580),
          text:
              '“Imagine if you had decided that taking a long time meant the dream was useless,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 449080),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 450080),
          text: 'Abbu nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 450080),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 453380),
          text: '“We did decide that once,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 453380),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 456140),
          text: '“We were wrong,” Uncle Farhan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 456140),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 458580),
          text: '“The project needed time.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 458580),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 463180),
          text: 'More importantly, you needed time,” Mr Rahman said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 463425),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 464732),
          text: 'Abbu looked at his children.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 464732),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 469452),
          text: '“Sometimes we ask why something is late,” Abbu said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 469452),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 472932),
          text: '“But maybe it is not late,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 472932),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 477412),
          text: '“Maybe we are still becoming ready for it,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 477958),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 479052),
          text: 'Abbu smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 479052),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 485558),
          text:
              'As they prepared to leave, Akhlaaq noticed a fresh blank page at the end of the old notebook.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 485558),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 487332),
          text: 'He picked up a pencil.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 487332),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 488898),
          text: '“What are you doing?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 489315),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 489837),
          text: 'Imaan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 489837),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 494053),
          text: '“Thinking about the next project,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 494554),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 496433),
          text: 'Imaan raised an eyebrow.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 496433),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 497310),
          text: '“Already?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 497811),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 498437),
          text: 'Imaan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 499189),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 499940),
          text: 'Akhlaaq paused.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 499940),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 503444),
          text: 'Then he slowly put the pencil down.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 503444),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 504444),
          text: '“Fine.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 504444),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 507934),
          text: 'First we finish learning from this one,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 507934),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 509276),
          text: 'Everyone laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 509276),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 521556),
          text:
              'The old dream had finally moved forward, not because anyone had rushed it, but because they had learned to keep doing the right thing while time passed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 521556),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 529988),
          text:
              'Moral Lesson: Patience The Things That Take Time teaches that impatience appears in many forms.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 529988),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 544308),
          text:
              'It can make us rush a task, demand an answer, expect perfection, compare ourselves with others, give up after mistakes, act before we understand, or become angry about something we cannot control.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 544700),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 550700),
          text:
              'Through Imaan and Akhlaaq, we learn that patience does not mean simply sitting and waiting.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 550700),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 570692),
          text:
              'Patience may mean slowing down enough to do something properly, trying again when the first attempt fails, giving ourselves time to improve, respecting another person\'s timing, waiting for evidence before making a judgement, and continuing useful work even when one part of a problem is still unresolved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 570692),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 584684),
          text:
              'The robot, the growing plants, the exhibition, and Abbu and Farhan\'s unfinished project all show the same principle in different ways: meaningful growth usually needs both effort and time.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 584684),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 593684),
          text:
              'Rushing can create more problems, while patient effort allows us to think clearly, learn from mistakes, and make better decisions.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 593684),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 598684),
          text:
              'Most importantly, patience is not the absence of an impatient feeling.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 599184),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 606676),
          text:
              'Imaan and Akhlaaq still feel restless, curious, frustrated, and disappointed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 606676),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 614676),
          text:
              'Their growth is shown when they begin to recognise those feelings and choose a better response.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 614676),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 616676),
          text: 'Final Moral',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 616676),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 619676),
          text: '“Some things cannot be rushed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 619676),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 630168),
          text:
              'A seed needs time to become a tree, a student needs time to learn, and a dream needs time to become real.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 630168),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 635868),
          text:
              'Patience means continuing to do the right thing while waiting for the right time.”',
        ),
      ],
    ),
  ],
);
